spice
* SPICE Netlist
VCC 3 0 DC [Value_Of_VCC] ; Define the DC value for VCC
I1 3 2 DC [Value_Of_I1] ; Define the DC value for current source I1
M1 2 1 0 0 NMOS_MODEL ; NMOS transistor, Q1
* Node 2 is both the drain of NMOS and the output node (Vout)
* Node 1 is Vin, connected to the gate of NMOS
* Node 0 is ground, connected to the source and body of NMOS